  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"512\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִנְחָה-חֲרֵבָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תּוּבָא<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּחֵטְא הַכֹּהֵן.</span></p><p data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"512\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צְמֵאָה-עֲיֵפָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּמוּשָׁה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּעֲווֹן הַמְּכַהֵן.</span></p><p data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"512\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי מִי לֹא יֶחֱטָא<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַל הָאֲדָמָה?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְצַדִּיק בָּאָרֶץ אֵין.</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תְּמַהֵר לִשְׁפֹּט אֶת חֵטְא הַצַּדִּיק.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גַּם הוּא אָדָם, וְדֶרֶךְ תְּשׁוּבָתוֹ תְּלוּלָה יוֹתֵר</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָגּוֹבַהּ מַגְבִּיהַּ אֶת הַנְּפִילָה</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div></span><div><span><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span></span><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִנְחָה חֲרֵבָה = 318 = בְּנֵי אַהֲרֹן</span></p></div><div><span><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2></span><span><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"></span></p></span><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>מִגְבָּעוֹת</b>' / '<b>קוֹבְעִין</b>'</span><br /><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>❖ מגבעת - כובע</span></span>.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>פִּתִּים</b>' / '<b>בִּצּוּעִין</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>❖</span></span>&nbsp;פתות לפתיתים - בָּצוּעַ לִבְצָעִים.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>כָּלִיל</b>' / '<b>גְּמִיר</b>'</span><br /><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>❖</span></span>&nbsp;שלם, סופי - גמור.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>פִּגּוּל</b>' / '<b>מְרַחַק</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>❖</span></span>&nbsp;מתועב, מאוס - דבר שנדחה והורחק</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>לְמָנָה</b>' / '<b>לֻחְלָק</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>❖</span></span>&nbsp;מנה - חלק.</span></span></span></li></ol><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">👁️ מבט חד</span></h2></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right; margin-left: 1em; text-align: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/e622075ec986bc9e4b.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"כוס קפה חצי־מלאה ללא אדים מונחת על שולחן, ברקע סביבת עבודה מטושטשת\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/e622075ec986bc9e4b.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כשהחום פג...</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></span></div>"
